helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	vi	Hỗ trợ nền tảng Java				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	vi	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Hỗ trợ nền tảng Java\"\>Hỗ trợ nền tảng Java\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	vi	$[officename] hỗ trợ nền tảng Java để chạy các ứng dụng, và thành phần dựa vào kiến trúc JavaBeans.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	vi	For $[officename] to support the Java platform, you must install the Java 2 Runtime Environment software. When you installed $[officename], you automatically received the option to install these files if they were not yet installed. You can also install these files now if required.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	vi	Để chạy các ứng dụng Java, cần phải kích hoạt khả năng hỗ trợ Java dưới $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	vi	Activate Java platform support by choosing \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Java\"\>$[officename] - Java\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	vi	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	vi	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	vi	$[officename] và Internet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	vi	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0800.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] và Internet\"\>$[officename] và Internet\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	vi	Phần này cung cấp thông tin về Internet. \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Từ điển thuật ngữ Internet\"\>Từ điển thuật ngữ Internet\</link\> diễn tả các thuật ngữ quan trọng nhất.				20200411 15:09:53
