helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0205.xhp	0	help	par_id3147578				0	vi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DRAW_TOOLBOX\"\>You can see the \<emph\>Drawing Object Properties\</emph\> bar in Writer and Calc. Select the menu View - Toolbars - Drawing Object Properties. The controls are enabled when a drawing object is selected. You see some different icons by default, whether the current document is a text document or a spreadsheet.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
