helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id7991882				0	vi	Change the properties of the selected picture, then click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153574				0	vi	Saving Bitmaps				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	vi	If you want to save in a format such as GIF, JPEG or TIFF, you must select and export the bitmap image.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id0801200803544667				0	vi	To export a bitmap in Draw or Impress:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3155414				0	vi	Select the bitmap image. You can also select additional objects, such as text, to be exported with the image by pressing the shift key while selecting or by opening a selection frame around all objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618				0	vi	Chọn \<emph\>Tập tin > In\</emph\>. Bạn sẽ thấy hộp thoại \<emph\>In\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3157139				0	vi	The \<emph\>Export\</emph\> command writes the picture with all applied filter effects to a file. The \<emph\>Save as Picture\</emph\> command in the context menu saves the picture without any filter effects, if the picture was inserted as a linked picture. An embedded picture will always be saved or exported with filters applied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443				0	vi	In the \<emph\>File format\</emph\> field, select the file format you want, for example GIF or JPEG.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3152462				0	vi	If you only want to export the selected objects, mark the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3150874				0	vi	If \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> is not marked, the entire page of the document is exported.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3149417				0	vi	Nhập tên mới cho trang tính và nhấn nút \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
