helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5758842				0	vi	Click \<emph\>Create Report in Design View\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4870754				0	vi	Follow the instructions in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				20200411 15:09:53
