helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	vi	Not all printers can print a paper up to its edges. Most of them leave an unprinted margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	vi	$[officename] offers a semi-automatic feature that enables you to print as close to the paper's edge as is possible.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	vi	Make sure that your printer has been setup under \<emph\>File - Printer Settings\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
