helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	vi	Under \<emph\>Margins\</emph\> you can define the maximum or minimum possible value for the page margins (left, right, top, and bottom). Click into the respective control, then press the Page Up or Page Down key. The preview displays a dashed line around the printable range.				20200411 15:09:53
