helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150499				0	vi	\<variable id=\"redlining\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining.xhp\" name=\"Recording and Displaying Changes\"\>Recording and Displaying Changes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	vi	The review function is available in %PRODUCTNAME for text documents and spreadsheet documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681				0	vi	When several authors are working on the same text or spreadsheet, the review function records and displays who made the various changes. On the final edit of the document, it is then possible to look at each individual change and decide whether it should be accepted or rejected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	vi	For example: You are an editor and are delivering your latest report. But before publication the report must be read by the senior editor and the proofreader, and both will add their changes. The senior editor writes "clarify" after one paragraph and crosses out another entirely. The proofreader corrects the spelling of your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	vi	The edited document comes back to you, and you can incorporate or ignore the suggestions of the two reviewers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	vi	Let's say you also e-mailed a copy of the report to a good friend and colleague who has done research on a similar topic in the past. You asked for a few suggestions, and the document is now returned by e-mail with your colleague's suggestions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	vi	As all your colleagues and the managers in your company work with $[officename], you can produce a final version of the document from the results you get back.				20200411 15:09:53
