helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910	22			0	vi	Under \<emph\>Contents,\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
