helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147303	12			0	vi	To attach a macro to the button, click the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab, and click the \<emph\>... \</emph\>button beside the button action that you want to run the macro. In the \<emph\>Assign Macro\</emph\> dialog, locate the macro that you want to use, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
