helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346	3			0	vi	Click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Table \</emph\>toolbar (Writer) or on the \<emph\>Line and Filling\</emph\> bar to open the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	vi	Click one of the predefined border styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	vi	This \<emph\>adds\</emph\> the selected style to the current border style of the table cells. Select the blank border style at the top left of the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> window to clear all border styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153666				0	vi	Setting a Customized Border Style				20200411 15:09:53
