helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3150040				0	vi	The language you select for your document determines the dictionary used for spellcheck, thesaurus and hyphenation, the decimal and thousands delimiter used and the default currency format.				20200411 15:09:53
