helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	vi	Under \<emph\>Default languages for documents\</emph\>, select the document language for all newly created documents. If you mark \<emph\>For the current document only\</emph\>, your choice will only apply to the current document. Close the dialog with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
