helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ctl.xhp	0	help	par_id3149047				0	vi	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+A or \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Left Shift Key - switch to left-to-right text entry				20200411 15:09:53
