helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ctl.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	vi	In $[officename] Writer text formatted in \<emph\>Thai language\</emph\> has the following features:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ctl.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	vi	In paragraphs with justified alignment, the characters are stretched to flush the lines at the margins. In other languages the spaces between words are stretched.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ctl.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	vi	Use the Delete key to delete a whole composite character. Use the Backspace key to delete the last part of the previous composite character.				20200411 15:09:53
