helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148456				0	vi	A system menu opens with menu commands like \<emph\>Move\</emph\>, \<emph\>Resize\</emph\> and \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
