helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802	5			0	vi	Click \<emph\>My Documents \</emph\>and click the \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> button, or double-click on \<emph\>My Documents\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	vi	In the \<emph\>Select Path\</emph\> dialog, choose the working directory you want and click \<emph\>Select\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
