helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3028143				0	vi	You can download the latest version of %PRODUCTNAME at \<link href=\"https://download.openoffice.org/\"\>download.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
