helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155092				0	vi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CALC_BTN_REGEX\"\>Specifies that regular expressions are enabled when searching and also for character string comparisons.\</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\> This relates to the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060101.xhp\" name=\"database functions\"\>database functions\</link\>, and to VLOOKUP, HLOOKUP and SEARCH.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
