helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090908.xhp	0	help	par_id3153914				0	vi	%LAMBDA_{deg","t}=1 + %alpha_deg SQRT {M_t over M_{(t=0)}-1}~"."				20200411 15:09:53
