helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3146976				0	vi	Open the context menu and choose the \<emph\>Rename Sheet\</emph\> command. A dialog box appears where you can enter a new name.				20200411 15:09:53
