helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152708				0	vi	SERIESSUM(x;n;m;coefficients) = coefficient_1*x^n + coefficient_2*x^(n+m) + coefficient_3*x^(n+2m) +...+ coefficient_i*x^(n+(i-1)m)				20200411 15:09:53
