helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	vi	Chọn lệnh \<emph\>Tập tin > Mẫu > Lưu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	vi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Template\</item\> box, type a name for the new template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	vi	Select a template category in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	vi	Nhấn vào nút \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	vi	To create a document based on the template, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - New - Templates and Documents\</item\>, select the template, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Open\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
