helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153120				0	vi	To convert a section into normal text, click \<emph\>Remove\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149631				0	vi	To make a section read-only, select the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Write Protection\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
